# Two stabs of 85+4x%, so 178% a target at level 1 and 330% at max. GMS runs
# 90+5x over 15 levels; stretching it to 20 keeps the same 165% a stab at the
# top, which is the rule every skill here follows. Dagger-only in GMS -- the
# weapon gate arrives with the daggers, and until then this and Lucky Seven are
# interchangeable, being the same 330% over the same 5 targets at max.
name: "Double Stab"
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ROGUE
max_level: 20
lines: 2
max_enemies: 5
base {
  skill_pct: 0.89
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.04
}
